This directory contains source code to 

    SQLiteDataset: C++ library for SQLite Database Engine(http://www.hwaci.com/sw/sqlite/).
    It is "client" interface and is convenient to handle few tables simultaneously,
    for querying, data navigation, records inserting and editing, transactions
    handling.

To compile the project, first download and compile the SQLite Database Engine (http://www.sqlite.org).
Then put in work directory file sqlitedataset.v-0.2.0.tar.gz, untar, configure and compile it:

	$>tar xzvf sqlitedataset.v-0.6.0.tar.gz
	$>cd sqlitedataset
	$>./configure --with-sqlite=<path-to-sqlite-installation> 
	$>make
	
Login as root and install the library:
	$su
	#make install
	#ldconfig
	
Run example dstest programm:

	$>.libs/dstest

Source of examples can be found in src/dstest.cpp
and in src/transact.cpp

This version of sqlitedataset support the new sqlite3 api and file format. For sqlite v.2 please use earlier 
versions of sqlitedataset